1
00:00:22,807 --> 00:00:26,691
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,091 --> 00:00:33,706
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,579 --> 00:00:40,717
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,055 --> 00:00:47,064
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,275 --> 00:00:51,196
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,407 --> 00:00:54,498
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,795 --> 00:00:59,030
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,015 --> 00:01:03,923
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,221 --> 00:01:07,107
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,417 --> 00:01:12,199
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,199 --> 00:01:16,779
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,779 --> 00:01:18,778
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,981 --> 00:01:24,763
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,147 --> 00:01:29,458
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,458 --> 00:01:31,966
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,212 --> 00:01:42,429
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:48,713
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,713 --> 00:01:51,631
=Episode 1=

19
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:54,560
I'll turn this place to ashes!

20
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,680
Die, all of you!

21
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:06,159
White Snake, perfect timing.

22
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:09,360
Today, I'll absorb your demon core.

23
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,680
Don't be so smug.

24
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:13,080
It's too early to say who will win.

25
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,560
You're overestimating yourself!

26
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,199
Everyone in Jinshan Temple, listen up!

27
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:18,360
Form the Water Shield Array,

28
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,680
to protect the people
and bring them into the temple.

29
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:24,800
Do you think you can stop me?

30
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,960
What fine nourishment you two are!

31
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,840
I'll gladly take you.

32
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:50,199
Suzhen!

33
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:08,879
Xu Xian, stop!
You'll get yourself killed!

34
00:03:33,507 --> 00:03:36,072
(One year ago)

35
00:03:37,599 --> 00:03:40,080
Suzhen, you've cultivated diligently
for 500 years.

36
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,280
Today, you're ascending.

37
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:43,039
Your effort has paid off.

38
00:03:44,039 --> 00:03:46,960
Suzhen, why did you hide your tail?

39
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:52,479
Since the beginning of my cultivation,
I've been guided by the Goddess.

40
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:54,919
Without her protection,

41
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:57,919
I wouldn't have ascended
to immortality so quickly.

42
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:01,080
Suzhen, after you ascend,

43
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,960
you'll be an immortal,
and I'm still a demon.

44
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,400
Can we still be together?

45
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:10,360
Silly girl, we'll always be together.

46
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:11,840
When that day comes...

47
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,840
Bai Suzhen.

48
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:20,879
I am here.

49
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,399
I shall enlighten you

50
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,199
to guide your ascension.

51
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:33,800
Goddess, why don't I feel any change?

52
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,879
Though you have cultivated diligently

53
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:43,480
with a kind heart,

54
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:47,560
and were meant to ascend today,

55
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:51,560
you have a karmic bond left unresolved.

56
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:54,560
May I ask how I should resolve it?

57
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:56,120
I see into your mind.

58
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:58,920
You have a missing memory.

59
00:05:00,519 --> 00:05:01,920
A missing memory?

60
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,800
You must retrieve that memory,

61
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,360
overcome the love trial,

62
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,399
and transcend all mortal desires.

63
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,839
Only then can you
achieve true ascension.

64
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:14,079
Goddess, I only seek the way of heaven.

65
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:16,240
I can cast all mortal matters aside.

66
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:20,120
How? You've never been involved
in mortal matters.

67
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:21,519
Grudges may be forgotten,

68
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:23,000
but favors must be repaid.

69
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,759
Such is fate,

70
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:28,079
and such is the way.

71
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:36,439
Xu Xian, run!

72
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,920
Once you repay this favor,

73
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:43,120
I will come to guide your ascension.

74
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,600
Xu Xian?

75
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:58,120
Fox Demon,
how does the mortal realm feel?

76
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,040
Suzhen, is that Xu Xian?

77
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,040
His skills look mediocre.

78
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:32,519
For a mortal, he's actually quite good.

79
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,560
Should I go help him?

80
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:37,199
Let's wait.

81
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,360
Xu Xian.

82
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,519
You'll get what's coming!

83
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:15,759
I curse you

84
00:08:16,839 --> 00:08:18,600
to lose your true love forever!

85
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:26,839
They say a fox demon's dying curse
is the most lethal.

86
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,959
What will he do now?

87
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:34,679
Then I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

88
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:52,039
Impressive skills!

89
00:09:04,799 --> 00:09:07,879
Goddess said you must marry him
to repay the favor,

90
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:10,320
but Xu Xian is a demon hunter.

91
00:09:10,919 --> 00:09:13,399
Repaying this favor won't be easy.

92
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,600
What's the big deal?

93
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,200
We've cultivated the righteous path.

94
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:19,679
Our demonic aura is long gone.

95
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:22,720
A demon hunter of his level
will never notice.

96
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,840
Thank you.

97
00:09:40,039 --> 00:09:42,039
Suzhen, don't worry.

98
00:09:42,039 --> 00:09:43,919
I know all about this.

99
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,480
You do?

100
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,720
Mortal romance is nothing more than

101
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:51,279
heroes saving maidens,

102
00:09:51,559 --> 00:09:53,159
love at first sight,

103
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,759
intimacy since childhood,

104
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:56,559
childhood companions,

105
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:58,200
and growing old together.

106
00:10:00,159 --> 00:10:02,320
In short, it's all about love.

107
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:05,639
You sure know a lot.

108
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,960
Just the basics.

109
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:08,799
I heard people say

110
00:10:09,159 --> 00:10:12,360
that for many upper immortals,
the final tribulation is love.

111
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:15,120
Only after tasting every mortal sorrow,

112
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,879
abandoning all desires,

113
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:18,279
and achieving pure detachment,

114
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:21,759
can one become an immortal
free of desires and longings.

115
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:23,399
Why is that?

116
00:10:26,039 --> 00:10:27,039
They're heartbroken.

117
00:10:27,639 --> 00:10:28,799
Did the Goddess say that?

118
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,759
That's what she meant, I suppose.

119
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,559
When you face
your tribulation to ascend,

120
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:39,240
I will definitely lend you a hand.

121
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,360
If you ask me,

122
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:42,799
being a mortal or a demon

123
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:44,840
is far better than being some immortal.

124
00:10:45,679 --> 00:10:49,240
But if you ascend to immortality,

125
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:51,120
I'll become an immortal too, right?

126
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,120
Walk properly.

127
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,879
Greetings, ladies.

128
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,120
Alright. What's the news?

129
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:05,799
That mortal Xu Xian

130
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:08,120
is about to be forced
to marry Master Wang's daughter.

131
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,960
What?

132
00:11:10,279 --> 00:11:12,840
Suzhen, if Xu Xian marries someone else,

133
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,720
you'll end up as a concubine!

134
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:19,000
A mere mortal dares to steal my man?

135
00:11:21,039 --> 00:11:22,639
You're marrying a mortal?

136
00:11:24,399 --> 00:11:27,480
Mind your own business,
you brat. Get lost!

137
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,480
Yes!

138
00:11:32,159 --> 00:11:35,360
Xu Xian, you're just a demon hunter.

139
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:37,440
Just ask around.

140
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,960
In this whole area,

141
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:42,000
all decent girls think you're a jinx.

142
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,000
So what?

143
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:46,799
Xu Xian, think of your aunt.

144
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:50,960
She wants to see you
start a family so bad.

145
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,960
Besides,

146
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:54,960
you can't stay all alone
for the rest of your life.

147
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:59,480
Erya's dowry is worth a fortune!

148
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:01,720
How can you put a price on love?

149
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,720
We meet again.

150
00:12:38,257 --> 00:12:42,416
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

151
00:12:44,883 --> 00:12:49,261
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

152
00:12:50,804 --> 00:12:56,629
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

153
00:12:57,398 --> 00:13:01,865
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

154
00:13:04,730 --> 00:13:09,171
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

155
00:13:11,367 --> 00:13:16,097
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

156
00:13:17,309 --> 00:13:23,422
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

157
00:13:24,085 --> 00:13:29,867
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

158
00:13:29,867 --> 00:13:36,130
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

159
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:42,799
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

160
00:13:42,970 --> 00:13:50,337
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

161
00:13:50,622 --> 00:13:56,169
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

162
00:13:56,660 --> 00:14:02,870
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

163
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:09,953
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

164
00:14:10,950 --> 00:14:16,603
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

165
00:14:17,437 --> 00:14:21,845
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

166
00:14:22,610 --> 00:14:25,198
♪Having ever loved♪
